  "body": "@AmandineLP found that an event (`$8W1KwdbJnRJkpkt_iIWKJt5Sr-Q620_fcBCc6BjsGfg`) failed to come down sync on her Element Web, as well as another user's Element Web. The event *did* come down sync on @AmandineLP's Hydrogen and iOS clients however.\r\n\r\nFrom my initial investigation, the event exists in `events` and `events_json`, is not rejected and is not an outlier. The event was sent at `2021-03-15 14:44 Z`, or `1615819475637`, with stream ordering `1878538882`.\r\n\r\nNext step is to investigate the sync requests from each device.\r\n\r\nReported by @dbkr.",
